WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come to hands and knees with knees wide for belly space.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale, soften the belly and lift the gaze.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale, round the back gently.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Flow for several rounds.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest in wide Child's Pose if comfortable.
